 please sign them in and be sure to sign them out before you take them home.
  The Sanctuary doors open at 6:00\, so as soon as you drop off your child y
 ou may go straight to the Sanctuary to get a seat. After the program\, we w
 ill take them back to the classroom to take off their costumes and you may 
 pick them up there. Please sign them out and you may go over to the Fellows
 hip Hall for cookies & punch. \n\nAngels-You may wear a white shirt and leg
 gings/pants. Please let the girls wear their hair down with no bows or pony
 tails. They will be wearing a headband halo.\n\nJoin with Google Meet: http
 s://meet.google.com/sxo-fgjf-mmf\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://suppo
 rt.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
